{"v":4,"catch":"跳來跳去尋找物品！","desc":"《HOPPING MAPPY》是NAMCO於1986年發行的動作遊戲。\n您已經逃離了 NYAMCO 的豪宅，但現在您必須在 NYAMCO 和其他人追逐您時使用新的彈簧桿武器躲避他們。\n在避開 NYAMCO 和 MEWKIES 的同時收集地面上的目標。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-01-20","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.0GB / Switch 0.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/55f141683d93457b0ceccf2d791ad4f48517b6e0427032ea5124dc2a8c5ccd16.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/445fe291380c803e44ac0fa77d07dd4de9d251c65267398d90216bf575ba2ef2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ebf0473b2d476c4027b37ef35c4d3e50ed9a23bdc57c9a4897da91349f07a9fa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c762d687bef38d2b622790ebbab7ce440a07e576734f831818fb1441bd681d8a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d9f2eeb390fe2b82a99c67ea7f07843cf3f2441b8fbb5eae3bc128f1c8aea893.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/93d1460d61f283e0b1560f65f430b62bdd9c7512d5bd358e6c86185c23978b0b.jpg"],"titleId":"01003b1016b3a000","dlc":[]}